                "text": "**JWT Implementation Flaws**\n\nVulnerabilities in JSON Web Token implementation and validation\n\n**Impact (type metadata)**\nAuthentication bypass, privilege escalation, session hijacking, or unauthorized access\n\n**Mitigation (type metadata)**\nUse secure JWT libraries, validate all claims, implement proper key management and expiration"
              },
